  "note": "Conformance corpus for the CANDIDATE pinned `uri` check (RFC 3986 URI, scheme REQUIRED). Each entry: id, value (string to test), expect (author's intended verdict of the PINNED check). The pinned regex body lives in pinned_body.json; each runner anchors it fully with its own portable end-of-input anchor and reports compiled + matched. The goal is (a) all 7 engines COMPILE the pinned regex, and (b) all 7 MATCH each value identically. `expect` is compared against the majority to flag any engine that deviates, and to document what the pinned check does vs strict RFC 3986. Non-ASCII raw UTF-8.",
